  "body": "Freshly updated, beautifully presented, and ready to enjoy, this is coastal living at its easiest.  The owner is highly motivated to sell, with all offers invited for consideration. With summer just around the corner, this is an outstanding opportunity to secure your own coastal haven and move in before Christmas.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a single professional dreaming of a home by the sea, a couple seeking a stylish coastal retreat, or simply looking for a lock-and-leave lifestyle, 101 Panorama Heights deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nPositioned on the third level of the sought-after Sea Breeze Apartments of Kensington Park, this light-filled one-bedroom home enjoys an elevated outlook across landscaped grounds and is adjacent to the native beauty of Eaves Bush Scenic Reserve.\r\n\r\nRecent upgrades include modern lighting, new carpet and stylish window furnishings, complemented by a calming contemporary colour palette, mirrored wardrobes that enhance the sense of space, and a bespoke office nook that seamlessly blends work and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe modern kitchen offers quality appliances, excellent storage and seamless flow into the open-plan living area, making everyday living and entertaining effortless. Relax with your morning coffee, soak up the sunshine, and enjoy the peaceful surroundings that make Kensington Park so desirable.\r\n\r\nA secure basement carpark and storage space -  with lift access - adds convenience, while the low-maintenance design means more time enjoying life and less time maintaining it.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the heated pool, gym and sauna, wander through beautifully maintained grounds, or take a short stroll to Orewa Beach, vibrant cafés, shops and local amenities.\r\n\r\nContact Jaimee or Mark, Kensington Park Property Specialists, to arrange your private viewing and Kensington Park tour, or visit the weekend open home.\r\n\r\nHarcourts Files: To view/download the property documents use the following link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/XAEV",
